book.pasterdream.shadow_cabin.page.0:
After a long period of exploration and comparison, I've made rough records of the various environments of this dark world.

Most regions of this world are extremely dangerous.

The mountains shrouded in thick shadow constantly birth dreadful monsters from flowing and congealing shadow — creatures so horrifying that merely laying eyes on them leaves you dazed;

book.pasterdream.shadow_cabin.page.1:
Plains piled with bones and broken ruins, where endless vengeful spirits let out shrill howls — no place where you could linger;

Only here, this “forest” grown full of fungal “trees,” is fairly safe.

The fungal “leaves” bear several glowing orbs, and in this pitch-black world, that light seems to drive away the shadows and hold back the birth of shadow creatures.
